 ## token.mjs
 
-### §explicit-token — the token comes only from the caller
-- Since: 2026-09-20
-- Decision: `resolveToken` returns `options.token` or throws. It never reads environment variables or files.
-- Forbidden: falling back to `process.env` (any variable name) or to a dotfile.
-- Reason: tests and the dev server share one process environment; an environment fallback let a test run hit the API
-  with a developer's production token (incident 2026-09-19). Passing it explicitly keeps the token's origin visible at
-  the call site.
+### §explicit-token — an explicit token wins; `process.env.API_TOKEN` is the fallback
+- Since: 2026-10-23, when the maintainer overrode the original 2026-09-20 decision (kept below under "Overridden").
+- Decision: `resolveToken` returns `options.token` if it is a non-empty string, else `process.env.API_TOKEN` if that
+  is a non-empty string, else throws. An empty string counts as missing in both places.
+- Forbidden: letting `API_TOKEN` take precedence over an explicitly passed token; falling back to any other
+  `process.env` variable or to a dotfile (the override covers `API_TOKEN` only).
+- Reason: the maintainer's decision of 2026-10-23; no further rationale was recorded. Trade-off: the 2026-09-19 risk
+  below is back for any caller that passes no token, since a test run can pick up a developer's exported production
+  `API_TOKEN`. `token.test.mjs` clears `API_TOKEN` before each test and restores it afterwards for that reason.
+- Overridden: from 2026-09-20 to 2026-10-23 the decision was "`resolveToken` returns `options.token` or throws. It
+  never reads environment variables or files", with falling back to `process.env` (any variable name) or to a dotfile
+  forbidden. Reason then: tests and the dev server share one process environment; an environment fallback let a test
+  run hit the API with a developer's production token (incident 2026-09-19). Passing it explicitly keeps the token's
+  origin visible at the call site.
+- Evidence: `token.test.mjs`
diff --git a/src/auth/token.mjs b/src/auth/token.mjs
index 97ea029..b632353 100644
--- a/src/auth/token.mjs
+++ b/src/auth/token.mjs
@@ -4,5 +4,9 @@ export function resolveToken(options = {}) {
   if (typeof options.token === "string" && options.token.length > 0) {
     return options.token;
   }
+  const envToken = process.env.API_TOKEN;
+  if (typeof envToken === "string" && envToken.length > 0) {
+    return envToken;
+  }
   throw new Error("resolveToken: pass { token } explicitly");
 }
